 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.06,
   "text": "The free weekend you're waiting for is never coming. Maya learned that the hard way."
  },
  {
   "s": 4.42,
   "e": 8.36,
   "text": "Her sister's wedding was eight weeks away and Maya wanted to give her a portrait she'd drawn"
  },
  {
   "s": 8.36,
   "e": 13.52,
   "text": "herself. She hadn't drawn since school. So she saved it for the weekend. Then a birthday took"
  },
  {
   "s": 13.52,
   "e": 17.6,
   "text": "one Saturday, chores took the next and three weekends later the paper was still blank."
  },
  {
   "s": 18.04,
   "e": 23.52,
   "text": "Five weeks left so she made a different choice. 20 minutes every morning before work. It cost her"
  },
  {
   "s": 23.52,
   "e": 28.18,
   "text": "the 20 minutes she used to spend scrolling in bed. Then she broke the portrait into one skill a week."
  },
  {
   "s": 28.18,
   "e": 33.32,
   "text": "Week one shapes then proportions then eyes then shading and in the last week the portrait itself"
  },
  {
   "s": 33.32,
   "e": 38.9,
   "text": "and every morning had one small job like 20 circles freehand. Then in week four the shading"
  },
  {
   "s": 38.9,
   "e": 44.72,
   "text": "came out muddy and she nearly quit. So what did she do? She didn't throw out the plan. She just"
  },
  {
   "s": 44.72,
   "e": 49.52,
   "text": "did that week's 20 minutes again the next morning. On the wedding day her sister unwrapped a framed"
  },
  {
   "s": 49.52,
   "e": 55.98,
   "text": "portrait of herself 35 mornings about 12 hours of drawing all in 20 minute pieces. Maya's portrait"
  },
  {
   "s": 55.98,
   "e": 60.9,
   "text": "started with one goal and one date. Yours can too send this to someone who's still waiting for"
  },
  {
   "s": 60.9,
   "e": 66.22,
   "text": "a free weekend. That's what demure is for. You archive your dream today so you can see it tomorrow"
  },
  {
   "s": 66.22,
   "e": 70.82,
   "text": "and break it down into small steps you can actually do and follow because tonight's reel"
  },
  {
   "s": 70.82,
   "e": 75.94,
   "text": "fixes the thing that wrecks most mornings your sleep. If you want to try it out I've put the link"
  },
  {
   "s": 75.94,
   "e": 76.5,
   "text": "in the bio."
  }
 ],
